%% Activity diagram: booking an event
flowchart TD
  A([Open event page]) --> B[Pick an allowed date in the calendar]
  B --> C[Read capacity for that date]
  C --> D[Choose guests]
  D --> E{Enough seats on the client?}
  E -- no --> F[Show 'Not enough seats'] --> B
  E -- yes --> G{Partner adding to list?}
  G -- yes --> H[Save cart item] --> I([Shopping list])
  G -- no --> J[Open payment window]
  J --> K{Demo payment accepted?}
  K -- no --> L[Show 'Payment declined' in window] --> J
  K -- yes --> M[Server: lock, check date, guests and seats again]
  M --> N{Still OK?}
  N -- no --> O[Booking Details: NOT CONFIRMED]
  N -- yes --> P[Create ticket code, save booking with VAT]
  P --> Q([Booking Details with Download PDF])
